    },
    "body": "Formatted Copy requests previously disturbed the initial Add decision and then either stopped early or emitted an Add-shaped suffix. Refine the existing shared derived-role and continuation routers, and learn Copy-conditioned lexical roots from the committed action and exact records. The retained artifact now emits, for example, `20 is 3 plus 17.\\n17 is 17.\\n` for Add followed by Copy-original, with exact identities and a correct subsequent independent calculation.\n\nRetain `5ed24f4e` over preserved parent `9ab64902`. Inherited lexical parameters and fixed geometry remain unchanged. The optional artifact witness reconstructs the full parent; action, read and learned-emission controls expose the dependency of the new output. Training labels are explicitly offline supervision; evaluation freely generates the complete response. No serving parser/template, matrix product, transformer or provider is added.\n\nValidation executed locally:\n- Construction 36/36; open, reversed/equal-value stress and post-selection signed/multidigit/name transfer each 24/24.\n- All 663 retained answers, prior panels, 254 transition replays and 72 exact lexical outputs pass. Twelve of fourteen old reports match exactly. Eighteen already-incorrect control rows change wrong outputs/IDs; all previously correct rows and control correctness totals are preserved, with individual differences retained.\n- Native API 91/91; 21 unique focused tests, source guard and four actual artifact checkpoint/allocation checks pass. Forty-two actual generated Rust equalities compile and execute. Release/offline builds, formatting and claim wording pass. Queue compatibility acknowledgements execute no tests.\n\nPreserve binding-only `a6faba85`, rejected joint `61e24998`, both source snapshots and all earlier material. This cycle charges 1,445.811 model seconds and 653.576 engineering-command seconds; cumulative model time is 14,153.352 / 15,450.000 seconds. The 2,100-second extension was recorded before use. Storage is 32,767,975,424 / 34,863,214,592 bytes with the prior charges, 16 MiB final metadata reserve and 128 MiB stop margin retained. No unique deletion or paid compute.\n\nThis qualifies finite formatted Add→Copy forms, not arbitrary instructions, general prose, Rust program synthesis, alpha or energy advantage. New-artifact browser/WASM/HTTP remains NOT_RUN. Next diagnose Copy→Add with a changed copied-record dependency, then refine the shared mechanism at the observed failure.\n\nReferences #1140. #1140 and the broader capability issues remain open. The result and source/evidence/resource receipts are linked from current-state and the canonical plan.\n",
